# Sample requests. In VS Code, install the "REST Client" extension and click
# "Send Request" above each one. Start the API first with `dotnet run`.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Valid projection
POST {{host}}/api/projection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 30,
  "currentBalance": 50000,
  "annualSalary": 90000,
  "contributionRatePercent": 12
}

### Invalid projection (expect 400 with a list of errors)
POST {{host}}/api/projection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 70,
  "currentBalance": -1,
  "annualSalary": 90000,
  "contributionRatePercent": 60
}
